  <!-- EN: single hammock -->
  <sd_hammock_single.label>单人吊床</sd_hammock_single.label>
  <!-- EN: A sling made of fabric used for sleeping. Fits one. The hammock is widly used by native tribes all over the Rimworlds. It's use to sleep save above the ground was recognized by explorers. Soon after it quickly became a must have in every ground crews inventory. Although on some planets it proved difficult to sleep in, due to low gravity. This lead to many funny storys of poeple floating away from their hammocks or getting entangled during the sleep. -->
  <sd_hammock_single.description>一种由布料制成的用于睡觉的吊床。可容纳一人。这种吊床在整个边境世界（RimWorlds）的土著部落中被广泛使用。 探险家们很快意识到，它能让人安全地在地面上方入睡。此后不久，它便迅速成为每支地面探险队装备清单中的必备品。尽管在某些行星上，由于重力较低，人们发现很难在吊床上入睡。这导致了许多趣事：有人在睡梦中从吊床上飘走，也有人被吊床缠住。</sd_hammock_single.description>
  <!-- EN: industrial single bed -->
  <sd_industrial_single_bed.label>工业单人床</sd_industrial_single_bed.label>
  <!-- EN: A comfy bed. Fits one. The boom of industrial production led to the need of more qualified workers on the more developed Rimworlds. The constraints of space drove the development of more advanced furniture. As a result this quite simple bed desgin emerged. -->
  <sd_industrial_single_bed.description>一张舒适的床。可容纳一人。工业生产的蓬勃发展使得较发达的边境世界对合格工人的需求日益增加。空间的限制推动了更先进家具的研发。由此，这种相当简单的床设计应运而生。</sd_industrial_single_bed.description>
